# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo, regardless of the OS or cloud-sync
# folder the working copy lives in. This repo is hosted inside a Google Drive
# synced folder, which had been rewriting files to CRLF and producing phantom
# whole-file diffs. `text=auto eol=lf` tells Git to store and check out LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
